  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Specialization in Migration Governance and Integrated Border Management in Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This joint UN project will deliver activities under the overall objective of supporting the efforts of the Government of Georgia to strengthen its integrated border management and migration governance capacities, ensuring compliance with the Visa Liberalization Agreement with the European Union, while at the same time implementing concrete measures in the context of the Ukraine response.</narrative>
  </description>
